  {
   "text": "Early on the first day at the breaking of the dawn",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The women walked to see the tomb, their every hope was gone",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the earth began to tremble and the guards became like dead men",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 2.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel rolled the stone away and sat upon it then",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 3.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 5.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I know that you are looking for Jesus, who was crucified",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 6.05,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He is not here",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 2.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He has risen, just as he said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.52,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
